The files in addresses/, walks/ and maps/ are databases derived from OpenStreetMap.

  © OpenStreetMap contributors
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

They are made available under the Open Database License 1.0:

  https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

The files in maps/ are extracts of the Protomaps basemap (https://protomaps.com/), which is built
from OpenStreetMap and comes under the same license.

cities.json is part of Dojazd and comes under the license in the root of the repository.
